  "instructions": [
    "Salt the cut eggplant with part of the sugar and pepper and let it release moisture.",
    "Fry half of the garlic in oil until crisp, then reserve the garlic chips.",
    "Brown the pork in the same pot and transfer it to a plate.",
    "Blot and brown the eggplant in batches until lightly colored on each side.",
    "Simmer water, vinegar, soy sauce, bay leaves, remaining garlic, pepper, and sugar into an adobo sauce.",
    "Return the pork and eggplant and braise until tender, then top the dish with garlic chips."
